{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a83325575a6bffbb84b217d4133726502d521e1abc1d92b5df1e46d7dac1f326", "ja": "歩、お疲れさま。\nそろそろ戻ろうか。", "zh": "步，辛苦了。\n该回去了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0f6867376544480f0fafb42deba7bf5d55f9e5010de13d989626d4fb044ffe8f", "ja": "オッケー！　なあ{$P$}、\n今日のライブ、どうだった？", "zh": "OK！对了，{$P$}，\n你觉得今天的演唱会怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3a37b30f0b9867b13070c24ff2ca0fdb33dc8a630d6bf2e0c2b1889f241f0c31", "ja": "もちろん、最高だったよ。\n歩も、自信たっぷりに踊ってたじゃないか。", "zh": "当然是非常棒啊。\n步在跳舞时也充满自信嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c7fd7a50a910733bf50ec9c73b8b4aa2ebb7e9fc685edb7310fbc1b7212f6d45", "ja": "へへっ、まあね！　ダンスはいつでも磨いてるし、\nもっと難しい注文でも、こなせると思うよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿！对啊！因为我一直都在磨炼自己的舞技，\n就算要我跳更难的舞，应该也没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1004_p", "source_sha256": "829e7bec1104bc5a8feef8394479fe17cab44224540008a530bf1be7f33f02fe", "ja": "そうか、頼りになるな。しかし、ライブ前に\nヘビを怖がっていたのと同一人物とは思えない……。", "zh": "是吗，真可靠。不过看你这样子，\n很难想像你在演唱会前还那么怕蛇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b3edad6c37d15c0a652b53a2344e3e90e728d9f720c8fd4df4e60dcd205dec27", "ja": "ちょっ……{$P$}！？\nなんで今、そういうコト言うんだよ～！", "zh": "等等……{$P$}！？\n你现在提这件事做什么啦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6e333f4d082276651c5e38a9290116df8b477316ba2e24e8cc7293d846b8e199", "ja": "べ、別に、本気で怖かったわけじゃないけどさ……\nでも、うう……。", "zh": "我、我又不是真的害怕……\n不过，呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1007_p", "source_sha256": "77e8c8b7155785bd0c348c342be108e9b470c830d9460f9ddc396e3108f7296c", "ja": "ああごめん、悪い意味で言ったんじゃないんだ。\nそういうところも、歩の魅力だと思うし。", "zh": "啊，抱歉，我不是要嘲笑你。\n我觉得那也是步的魅力之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "14d738fe3250de3d7b163113ea2fb4e0dc261c654c6a87c0a2d86cbff35d8a9b", "ja": "ど、どういうトコロだよ、もうっ！\n{$P$}、ちょっとバカにしてるだろ！", "zh": "那、那算什么魅力啊！真是的！\n{$P$}，你是不是在捉弄我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0ca2ea220cc0c812abeb0144924f7584acd1608899ceca31092d1773e2d1cba1", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……ライブでいつもカッコいい\n歩の素顔が可愛いのは、魅力的だと思うんだけどな。", "zh": "没有，我不是那个意思……步在演唱会上一直都很帅气，\n但私底下其实很可爱，我觉得这样很有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9a06d36e0793f6f46d5ec74c843ce24f131ca5658fed5b21cd9f6e76834044b7", "ja": "えええっ！？\nい、いきなり何言ってるんだよ～！", "zh": "什么──！？\n你、你怎么突然说这种话啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e6a8e0f467ab3bfeff38f160cf0838715bfd614fcaaa591718b48a321231ab57", "ja": "うん。だから、自然でいいんじゃないかってことだ。\nそのままの歩で、十分魅力的なんだから。", "zh": "嗯。所以，我觉得你保持自然就好了。\n真实自然的步就很有魅力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6c6657246235f64a4621c458ac8e29866dece7172888975890c6279b8d2edbcb", "ja": "うう……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6deb22995bd42832f82746d21243e23e668ee3b58be462da19b9945ae9cec773", "ja": "もちろん、歌もトークも上手くなって欲しいけどな。\nでも歩がダンスにかける情熱は、カッコいいと思う。", "zh": "当然我也希望你的歌唱和谈话能力能进步啦，\n不过我觉得步对舞蹈付出的满满热情真的很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b3b6a3661db2891a1313f21709052c5f0de48f3bca420d287dee0dbece36d998", "ja": "ううっ……{$P$}！\nアタシ、先に戻ってる！", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}！\n我先回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2438b313cef7f44261bfacc3c127ac6b180a05819cf10953f2cd45703ccae772", "ja": "歩？", "zh": "步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e8e6b826f6d44195b6aad0efa8387c672f638991aaf2d1bc51b626ea79be4c28", "ja": "このまま{$P$}と話してたら、\nおかしくなりそうだから！　じゃあね、シーユー！", "zh": "{$P$}，再继续和你聊下去，\n我整个人都不对劲了！先走啦，See you！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0044_1017_p", "source_sha256": "db3fd3d35ea23e0ec6f855be9766d3ff2a5acb15c571c9da29eee16e47088ea8", "ja": "歩！？　うわっ、砂の上なのに速いな……！\nおーい、歩ー！", "zh": "步！？哇！在沙滩上居然能跑这么快……！\n喂──步──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
